To create the DAO using the admin factory, so that the DAO is its own admin, the
execution message needed is:

```
{
  "instantiate_contract_with_self_admin": {
    "code_id": 365,
    "instantiate_msg": "",
    "label": "NAME"
  }
}
```

to be executed on `osmo102pg8quxtvhye3k4rcqwh7j5zwf5ekhcvlquafjjxjnarhu38qzstkdm6p`
